Manage the installed MCP Auth server's connectors and resources

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster mcp-auth [command]

Available Commands:
  connector   Manage the bundled MCP Auth identity connector
  resource    Wire an OAuth MCP server's own sign-in and resource client into MCP Auth

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for mcp-auth

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging

Use "mcp-runtime cluster mcp-auth [command] --help" for more information about a command.
